payload.longDescriptionOriginal:
Search and analyze IP Author's 183M-publication global patent corpus and US prosecution data. 
• Run guided prior-art, freedom-to-operate, patent-landscape, evidence-of-use, and SEP-essentiality workflows;
• Inspect application file wrappers, claims, citations, specifications, and response arguments;
• Compare examiners; and 
• Prepare downloadable research artifacts. 
Results are research support, not legal opinions, and should be reviewed by qualified counsel.
